window.products.push({"id":707008,"name":"Artunique 23pc Gold Party Decorations & Party Supplies Kit | Huge Latex and Confetti Gold Balloons (18) | Gold Sequin Table Runner (1) | Gold Fringe C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919Po5TSQyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gold Party Pack This kit includes 4 of Amazon's BEST SELLING party decorations. Your gorgeous party set includes 9 BEAUTIFUL gold balloons, and 9 BEAUTIFUL clear balloons with gold foil confetti, 1 SPARKLING gold sequin table runner, 2 GORGEOUS gold fringe curtains for photo's, and 2 30ft long spools of metallic gold ribbon. Instead of spending hours and hours choosing individual items to decorate and 35$+ to buy each item separately, you can save money and time and buy everything you need to give your party that CLASSY and ELEGANT feel. Everything you need, packed into a neat box ready to be set up. Ensure you only fill the balloons with high grade helium. Low grade impure helium may only cause the balloons to float for 2-3 hours. If inflated to the proper size with high quality helium, the balloons should float anywhere from 8-12 hours. Please note there can be some variation depending on weather. Keep helium inflated balloons in cooler temperatures and out of direct sunlight, as extreme heat can cause balloons to pop. This party supplies kit is perfect for Bachelorette Parties, Engagement Parties, Bridal Showers, Birthday Parties, Retirement Parties, Christmas Parties, New Years Parties, Fiesta Parties, and any other occasion that could use some SPARKLE. Cinco de Mayo Balloons, Baby Sprinkle Decorations, Engagement Party Decorations, Fiesta Balloons, Birthday Decorations for Women, Engagement Balloons, Party Decorations for Adults, Engagement Decorations, Party Supplies, Birthday Party Supplies, Glitter Balloons, Pastel Balloons, Metallic Balloons, Latex Balloons, Balloons Bulk, Gold Birthday Decorations, Birthday Ballons, Mother's Day Balloon, Mother's Day Balloons, Sprinkle Party Decorations, Glitter Party Decorations, Clear Balloons with Gold Confetti, Gold Glitter Balloons, Large Confetti Balloons, globos para fiestas, decoraciones para fiestas, gold decorations for party, birthday decorations for men","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919Po5TSQyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artunique","source_asin":"B07GZ6L896","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GZ6L896","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GZ6L896","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":707009,"name":"16 Slot Ice Cube Tray - Easy Release White Ice Mold with Stackable Design for 1 x 1.25 Inch Cubes by Back of House Ltd. (4-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tvw3rYsbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The First Step to Making Something Great Chunks of frozen water is the foundation of all the best cold drinks, slushies, cocktails, and smoothies. When you feel like making something delicious, struggling with step one can ruin the whole experience. Ice trays may be simple, but they sure make things complicated sometimes: if it's not spilling all over the place on the way to the freezer, it's nearly breaking a nail when you try pry out an ice cube. Sounds dramatic, but once you try a flexible plastic tray that has the best features of both plastic and silicone trays, you'll never go back! Why You'll Love It Back of House, Ltd's ice cube trays look like your everyday ice tray. That's because they are, but with all the right qualities for the best ice-making experience. Made from a durable yet flexible plastic, these molds won't flop over and spill the water on the way to the fridge, and they won't crack or break when removing the ice. Once the ice is frozen, simply twist the tray to each side and see how they easily each cube comes out of the mold. Each of the 16 slots creates a 1\" x 1.25\" ice cube that's great for standard drinks, mixed drinks, and even making smoothies. The plastic materials nonstick texture is dishwasher safe and easy to clean by hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tvw3rYsbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Back of House Ltd.","source_asin":"B07B4KL6ZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B4KL6ZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B4KL6ZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
