window.products.push({"id":707043,"name":"Panacea Products 15321 Humidifying Iron Kettle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81syekDKcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Panacea old fashioned fireplace iron kettle humidifier adds moisture and warmth to your room's air when it's dry during winter. Cast-iron construction makes it last a lifetime. This Kettle Humidifier provides steam which provides humidity and added comfort in your home. Simply fill with water & place on wood stove. Attractive handle for easy portability and handling. Cast iron construction Adds moisture to air during dry winter Solid and heavy Lasts a lifetime Creates a very light natural steam Save money on power, completely . This is the way Grandma used to do it. She'd fill a cast iron kettle with water, set it on the stove and let it steam. Worked wonders for dry skin in the wintertime. If Grandpa was feeling stuffy she'd throw in a eucalyptus leaf or two. This Kettle looks a lot like Granny's. . . heavy-duty cast iron construction, metal coil handle. . . a reminder of simpler times.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81syekDKcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panacea Products","source_asin":"B000MXH472","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000MXH472","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000MXH472","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":707044,"name":"ZUNMOS Home Office Ergonomic Mesh Computer Desk High Back Swivel Task Executive Chair with Soft Armrests Padded Lumbar Support and Adjustable Rotatabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":97.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713PSypg31L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ergonomic Backrest & Seat: The lumbar support of this S-shaped high back office chair mimics the natural curve of spine movement, perfectly fits the body curve, provides spinal protection for long hours of sitting, is the body feels light as floating while maintaining perfect balance. The compact mesh office chair will allow you to fully enjoy your sitting while working or resting. Multiple Adjustments: The desk chair's back can be adjusted to reclining at 90°- 120°. Cushioning lumbar angle effectively reduces the discomfort and fatigue caused by sitting for a long time, which makes it comfortable for you to take a short nap between work. The seat height can be adjusted from 17.4\" - 20.6\", with adjustable flip up and down armrests, it can perfectly adapt to people's heights and different desktop heights. Breathable Mesh Chair: The seat back are made of high-quality breathable mesh material, which effectively reduces sweat, keeping you cool and comfortable at all times, and the seat cushion is also made of durable textile material, which is breathable while soft and comfortable. The high-density mesh office chair cushion support has a certain restraining effect on the vertical spine, so it will not cause local pain in the ischium, effectively achieving a certain upright sitting posture. It also can resist deformation and provide you with support that lasts all day. Sturdy & Durable: Our ergonomic chairs with arms offer heavy-duty durable nylon bases, gaslift safety devices and rolling casters that can support adults weighing up to 250 pounds. The high-back desk chairs are paired with other high-quality office supplies and meet strict BIFMA standards for maximum safety. 360 degrees swivel multi-directional wheels ensure smooth-rolling for longer periods of time, providing freedom of movement and ease of communication with others. Easy To Install & Warranty: All swivel task chairs come with a 1-year warranty, so email us directly and we'll get you an effective solution as soon as possible. With clear instructions and tools, you can also follow the video for assembly (about 15 to 20 minutes). This lumbar support rolling chair is suitable for office, game room, living room, bedroom, study, etc. It will make your space more modern and elegant. Target gender: unisex Item shape: L-Shaped Item shape: L-Shaped Unit count: 1.0","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713PSypg31L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZUNMOS","source_asin":"B0B4284FG2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4284FG2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4284FG2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
