window.products.push({"id":707169,"name":"Macaron Boxes | Pack of 10 Macaron Box with Scalloped & Gold Foil Design | Chocolate Covered Strawberry Boxes Packaging | Macaroon Boxes Packaging | T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716Y0ooNc7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"*Macarons Not Included* Show Off Your Delightful Creations: These 6.25\" x 2\" x 2\" bakery boxes provide an elegant protective enclosure for display and transport giving customers a sneak peak of its contents triggering their desire to purchase and devour! Produce that wow factor for a perfect gifting experience that will win you extra points! A beautiful macaron container is just what you need to take your baking business to the next level! Premium Quality Clear Display Macaroon Containers: Cute and trendy scalloped macaron boxes with gold foil design in a neutral color. Comes in a pack of 10. Designed to hold (6) 1.5 in (in diameter) macarons but can hold more or less depending on the size of your treats! Grease resistant macarroon boxes. Your desserts will be better protected during transit in sturdy clear treat boxes versus flimsy paper ones. Clear packaging boxes help display your hard work and beautiful creations! Easy To Assemble -Step-By-Step Diagram: Macaron Boxes will come unassembled. Instructions on back of packaging. Each macaron clear box comes with a protective layer of plastic that keeps the plastic safe, clean, and clear until ready to be put to use. Assembly is quick and easy; no tools, glue or special skills required. This macaron box for 6 is the perfect companion to your macaron mat. Multipurpose Applications - These versatile bakery boxes can be used to package different small desserts. Chocolate covered strawberries, mini cupcakes, mini muffins, cookies, candy, cake balls, petit fours, truffles, and more. Can be used as favors or gifts for different events. Keep your delicate treats safe with this macaron storage container as it is easy to transport and store. These boxes for chocolate covered strawberries are great for Valentines Day, Mothers Day, and much more! Perfect As A Display Case & Easy-To-Clean / Reusable- Showcase your beautiful macarons or chocolate covered strawberries in these quality casings! The clear sturdy plastic serves as a great stand or backdrop for photographing your macarons, showing them off to your friends, or in your store. The treat boxes with window are also easy to clean and reusable! Just rinse the outer containers in warm soapy water to clean. Add these macaroon boxes to your macaroon baking supplies!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716Y0ooNc7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belle Packs","source_asin":"B09L7BLLTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L7BLLTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L7BLLTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
