window.products.push({"id":707203,"name":"Burfocus Ice Cube Tray with Lid and Bin, Ice Trays Ice Maker for Freezer with Container Silicone Ice Cube Tray Mold Easy Release BPA Free Large Ice Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71stQ4wwyeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊【Food Grade Silicone】Silicone big ice cube trays are made of food grade silicone which is BPA free, nontoxic, odorless, and durable. Ice trays is safe and can be frozen and used repeatedly for a long time. NOT DISHWASHER SAFE. 🧊【Ice Ball Container&Scoop】: Ice trays for freezer with lid and bin are stackable, which can be easily put into the refrigerator and help you save space in the freezer. Contains:2*32-pcs ice cube tray, Ice bucket can hold about 120 ice balls which can make more than 20 cups of cold drinks. ice trays for freezer with lid and bin set is perfect for a party. You can enjoy ice drinks at any time. 🧊【Square ice cube trays】Ice Trays for Freezer is smooth and durable. The lid and The edges of the tray are designed higher for easy filling Water, not easy to spill. Water don’t fill above the max fill line to keep ice cubes in the perfect nugget shape instead of sticking together. using scoop to take ice is more convenient and hygienic than using hand. 🧊【Easy to Release】The high quality ice cube mold is durable. After taking the mold out of the freezer, Put the tray up-side- down, press the ice box to release the ice press to take ice, fast and easy. Perfect kitchen gadgets and tools for people who like drink ice. The silicone ice tray is very suitable for friends/family party. 🧊【Multiple Uses】This set of mini ice cube trays create 0.9inch ice balls that are the perfect size for for whiskey, cocktails, smoothies, juices or baby food. You can also put fruits, jelly, baby food, coffee, vegetable puree, yogurt and chocolate into molds to make the ice cubes you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71stQ4wwyeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"burfocus","source_asin":"B0BW58RXG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW58RXG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW58RXG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
