window.products.push({"id":707264,"name":"GoT - I Drink and I Know Things - Etched Beer Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zSTeLBjzL.jpg","description":"I Drink and I Know Things glass etching inspired by GoT The design is carefully laser etched onto the glass giving it a beautiful frosted look. Now you can drink your beer, or any other beverage in style while geeking out a little (It's a good thing) These are thick, high-quality beer mugs that are made to last. These mugs can each fit 15 oz and are perfect for every occasion. All of these items are handmade, therefore, there might be slight differences from one item to the next. That being said, the quality of the product will not be hindered. Each glass, in essence, is unique. These glasses are dishwasher safe, the etching is permanent and will not fade over time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zSTeLBjzL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chico's 8Bit Designs","source_asin":"B01MDNWPAE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MDNWPAE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MDNWPAE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":707265,"name":"Fortuning's JDS Coffee Station Organizer, Double Sided Wooden Coffee Accessories Organizer with Black Block, Farmhouse K-cup Coffee Pod Holder as Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NvZijoISL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Double Sided Farmhouse Lettering】Not only is this coffee bar bin box handcrafted from high-quality pine wood, but also the burnt wood finish with white spray-printed \"Coffee Bar\"\"Love is brewing\" farmhouse lettering reflects your love of coffee, rather than leaving blank backside, adding relaxed feeling to your coffee station. Flat height design makes it easy to get your items from all angles. 💙【Make Life More Interesting】Coffee station organizer set comes with a black wooden sign block, black and white color matching corresponds to the combination of black coffee and milk, it says \"BUT FIRST coffee\"\"coffee is always a good idea\", you may try adding this interesting sign to make your the small coffee bar more eye-catching. This coffee bar decor will be a great way to brighten up your life. ✨【Save Countertop Space】Have you found that there is no space to storage your coffee bar accessories? If you say yes, this k cup holder will be your must-have! Coffee pod organizer can hold about 40 coffee capsules, whether tea, sugar bag and instant coffee, or mixing sticks and straws, seasoning bottles, snacks, candies,coffee condiment, just store all in one Fortuning's JDS coffee bar organizer. Finding what you need super easy and start your day in a good mood. ☕【Create Your Own Coffee Corner】When coffee station organizer is placed in the coffee bar, living room, kitchen shelf, even hotel lobby, motel breakfast service area, this coffee station will let you say goodbye to chaos. Meanwhile, our coffee organizer is also equipped with two jute rope handles, so you can bring them to the countertop to use as a snack rack for entertaining guests or party table decor. 📦【Gifts For Coffee Lovers】This farmhouse coffee bar organizer is a nice gift on housewarming, Thanksgiving, Christmas or birthday parties to your family and friends, also a great addition to your coffee station decor or office countertop. And we offer a 100% satisfaction guarantee if the good is damaged in transit or has other issues, please sent message to us via Amazon for replace or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NvZijoISL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fortuning's JDS","source_asin":"B0B1W8JCSN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1W8JCSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1W8JCSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":707266,"name":"Hanaoyo Christmas Tree Topper Bow with LED Light, Large 13” x 48” Christmas Tree Topper Bow, Handmade Buffalo Plaid Tree Topper, Tree Topper Bow for C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UWIguc8bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Size & Easy to Use】Upgraded Christmas tree topper, large size: 11\" x 55\" , which can meet the different sizes of Christmas tree. There may be slight deformation in transit and the tree topper bow you receive may have some wrinkles, but it can be easily bent and you can adjust the tree topper to make it a perfect shape, adding an exquisite accent to your Christmas tree. 【With LED Lights】Our Christmas tree topper bow with LED lights, the switch comes with batteries, and you don't need to buy extra batteries to use it, the white lights can create a warm atmosphere for you, bringing comfort and elegance to your family. 【Classic & Exquisite Design】The Christmas tree bow with pine needles and pine cones, which is very vivid and attractive. The bow flutter is printed with snowflake and Christmas tree patterns, and comes with shiny glitter, perfect for the festival atmosphere. The classic and elegant style never fades, it is the perfect gift to decorate your Christmas tree. 【Exquisite Handmade】Our large Christmas tree topper bow is 100% handmade with stylish three-dimensional patterns, rich colors and delicate raw materials. There are exquisite glittering materials on the bow, which is very dazzling and attractive, the delicate structure and workmanship make it look unique, providing a brilliant accent to your festive decorations! 【Perfect Christmas Gift】The shiny Christmas tree topper bow can be applied to Christmas trees, front doors, wreaths, walls, fireplaces, porches and other locations to add a festive atmosphere. It is a perfect Christmas decoration gift, you can present this Christmas tree decoration to your family, friends, colleagues or others to send them a best wish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UWIguc8bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hanaoyo","source_asin":"B0B9R46S2T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9R46S2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9R46S2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":707267,"name":"CUCRAF Linen Kitchen Curtains 36 Inch Length Farmhouse Linen Textured Tier Cafe Curtains Rod Pocket Light Filtering Small Window Curtain for Bathroom/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ro1rITLZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package includes 2 panels of 27\"W x 36\"L semi sheer kitchen window curtains. Each panel has 2.7 inch high pole pocket, which works well with tension rods or normal rods, easy to install and slide. Natural Style: Our linen sheer curtains are made of lightweight and breathable fabric suitable for use at home. The color is light and elegant, and can match well with various decorative styles. Simple pleats in rod pockets add an elegant look. Light filter: These cafe curtains are of moderate thickness, allowing in light while still providing privacy. They can not only gently filter the light, but also enjoy the beautiful scenery outside the window. You can cover the lower part of the window for privacy, or use shorter curtains alone for a simple decorative effect on the kitchen. Wide Application: These curtains are not only suitable for the kitchen window, but also for your glass door, bathroom, cafe store or living room windows. Farmhouse, modern, classical or any other decoration style can be easily blended in. Easy Care: Machine washable in cold gentle cycle. Iron on low setting as needed. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ro1rITLZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUCRAF","source_asin":"B0BQ6RQPHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ6RQPHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ6RQPHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
