window.products.push({"id":707287,"name":"\"Motorcycle\" Bottle Opener and Cap Catcher, Wall Mounted - Handcrafted by a Vet - Solid Pine 3/4\" Thick - Cast Iron Opener & Galvanized Bucket - To Em","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v6XI-VpcL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Superior Quality - Made of 100% Solid Wood It's Over 15\" Tall and 3/4\" Thick! This isn't one of those little namby pamby fiber board, particle board, cheap plastic or even worse yet, used wood from abandoned old pallets and passed off as \"Reclaimed Barnwood\"! Photos are examples and exact grains/colors may vary due to differences in monitors and every tree is different as well. My photography does not do justice to the beauty of the wood. These are not made in bulk in China. We hand select the wood, sand and stain by hand. Just to make sure it will last and provide exceptional durability, we add 2 finishing coats of a Professional Grade Polycrylic Seal. It doesn't leave that ugly blob of caps like the magnetic ones do. Mounts securely to a wall, fence post, or anything a screw will bite into. 2 mounting screws included for easy install using the pre-drilled keyholes. Unlike other openers, it won't sway and wobble when you open your beverage You can even do it one handed! Slide off Bucket is easy to empty. Perfect finishing touch for your Kitchen, Patio, Home Bar, Mancave, Garage, RV, or She-Shed These well-made, old fashion bottle openers are for home brewers, craft beer lovers, mini bars, house warming, holidays, birthdays, retirements, or anyone who opens bottles! Just pop the tops and let them fall. The bucket catches them. They also don't bend the caps to reuse for craft purposes. Our Huge Selection Will Make Gift Giving EASY for you. WE have Bottle Openers that will relate to personality, jobs, humor, pets, and more! You are sure to find a personal gift for anyone on your list. Over 100+ Different Styles Type - CherryPic Junction Bottle Openers - (no \"K\" in CherryPic) in your Amazon Search Bar to see the Massive Selection! Made in the USA - Vet Owned Small Business","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v6XI-VpcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CherryPic Junction","source_asin":"B07BQDJJLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BQDJJLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BQDJJLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
