window.products.push({"id":707317,"name":"Camping Camp Out Party Supplies Pack Serves 16: 7\" Dessert Plates Beverage Napkins Cups and Table Cover with Birthday Candles (Bundle for 16)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mjo3ZzBuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM BIRTHDAY PLATES NAPKINS CUPS TABLE COVER: Our set of brightly colored birthday plates napkins cups table cover set contains 16 plates 16 napkins 16 cups 1 table cover. Perfect for hot and cold food. It will make that cute addition to any party or occasion. A fantastically-themed party table set that also includes 24 birthday candles in 4 colors from LLILYKAI VALUE BUNDES that creates the perfect mood for the birthday celebration. ULTIMATE USAGE: Perfect for all ages birthday parties from 1st to 16th to 21st, use our set at any special occasion which is great for outdoor summer gatherings, BBQ's, garden or beach suppers and any party you may want to have. Guaranteed to enhance and brighten up every event with its brilliantly colorful design. HIGH QUALITY: Our birthday plates napkins cups table cover party supplies are produced with top quality materials. The birthday napkins are made of quality paper, and the party plates are made thick and sturdy with white card which makes it durable yet practical. And they are folded around the outer edge to give it additional strength. The birthday plate can hold up to any meal. DIMENSIONS: These disposable 16 themed party plates are approx. 7 inch in diameter, while these party plates are cute and decorative, they are strong enough to handle even the heaviest of any event foods and snacks. Paired with these high quality 16 themed party beverage napkins approx. 5.5 inch when folded and 11\" when unfolded. The paper cups can hols up to 9oz. of hot or cold beverages and the rectangle table cover measures 54\" x 102","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mjo3ZzBuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LLILYKAI VALUE BUNDLES","source_asin":"B07VBWSQSL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VBWSQSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VBWSQSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":707318,"name":"HOLMES HAWF3195-RU Remote Window Fan with Accutemp Plus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411BAQRPJ8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sit back and relax with a Holmes remote control Window Fan with AccuTemp Plus Amazon.com The Holmes window fan is the mild climates answer to air conditioning. Though not equipped (or intended) to actually cool intake air, the fan is handily designed to kick on automatically when ambient temperatures start to rise. Fully programmable, the twin fan design features individual controls, so you can set it to intake fresh air, exhaust stale air, or do both simultaneously. It comes with three speeds and a helpful 16-hour timer, so that it can already be powered up when you awake or arrive home from work. The AccuTemp digital thermostat ranges from 60 to 80 degrees F, and the fan is designed to fit double-hung or slider windows from 24 to 37 inches. If you want to use it for casement windows, Holmes will supply a separate mounting bracket free of charge. The company also includes a five-year warranty. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411BAQRPJ8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holmes","source_asin":"B00009N7HD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00009N7HD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00009N7HD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
