window.products.push({"id":707479,"name":"Oversized Round Floral Flower Green Leaf Beach Towel, Thick Soft Circle Table Yoga Mediation Mat Beach Blanket, Soft Microfiber Sand Free Quick Dry Mu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517rXGAUWCL._AC_.jpg","description":"【DIMENSION & SOFT MATERIAL - ROUND BEACH TOWEL】The round beach towel is 50 inches in diameter and weights about 1.28 pounds. It can be folded into small pieces and easy to carry.every thick towel is made of top microfiber fabric. The surface of the floral beach towel is quick to dry, sand-proof, soft, breathable and terry, not easy to ball and deform. Professional trimming and beautiful tassels also improve the quality, durability and fashion of towels. 【MULTIPURPOSE TOWEL - FLORAL BEACH TOWEL】Our floral beach towel is not only a comfortable plush towel or beach blanket, but also as a luxury bath towel, indoor bathroom towel, custom blanket, psychedelic wall tapestry, sauna blanket, home decoration, outdoor picnic blanket, swimming towel, bedspread, yoga mat, tablecloth and Meditation carpet. You can also hang it in the room as a decoration, which will definitely add some fashionable atmosphere to your room. 【SAND FREE AND QUICK DRY - CIRCLE BEACH TOWER】This oversized beach towel is made of 100% microfiber fabric. The soft green leafy beach towel has super absorbent and high quality, which can absorb more moisture and dry faster than ordinary beach towels. In addition, this microfiber beach towel is not easily stained with sand, leaves or other fragments. When you are ready to leave, you just need to shake the towel, and the sand on the towel can be easily shaken off. 【EXQUISITE & PERFECT GIFTS】The design of this round beach towel is very exquisite. There are many flower patterns and green leaf patterns on the beach towel, as well as beautiful tassels. This design is suitable for all ages. So you can give it to your family and friends at a birthday party, family gathering, Christmas or New Year. They will definitely feel your sincere greeting and blessing, this towel will be the best choice for holiday gifts. 【WASHING INTRODUCTION AND SERVICE】We have some suggestions on how to clean this round towel. Before you start using the towel, we recommend that you clean the towel separately to remove the remaining fluff from the manufacturing process. You can wash it with cold water with your hand or washing machine and hang it to avoid bleaching or overheating. In addition, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us for a solution, and we will reply to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517rXGAUWCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RosieLily","source_asin":"B09877W3TQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09877W3TQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09877W3TQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
