window.products.push({"id":707482,"name":"100 PCS Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, Round Air Fryer Paper Liners, Natural Parchment Paper for Air Fryer, Non-Stick, Oil-Proof, Food Grade Paper ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7112Ek382OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Healthy ＆ Tasty】: Our air fryer paper liners are designed with food grade parchment paper with quality in mind, which is waterproof, oil-proof, non-stick and 100% healthy. Easy to use, lightweight and practical, keeps any kind of food at its most perfect looking and without affecting the taste of the food. Heat resistant, can withstand temperatures up to 428 degrees Fahrenheit. Notice: Do Not preheat your air fryer without food on top, please always use with enough food on the paper liners. 【Keep Your Air Fryer Clean】: The round disposable paper liner can effectively keeps your air fryer away from food residues, makes clean up a breeze and your air fryer will as clean as unused. You don’t need to tear, fold, cut, nor bend, just take one out and put it in your air fryer when you are ready to cook. Greaseproof paper liners heightened edge 4.5cm, can protect the side of fryers and prevent food from sticking to them. 【No Interfering Internal Air Circulation】: The heat is generated by air circulation from the pan's wall, Our parchment paper for air fryer won't affect the air circulation. When baking, the grease comes out to the paper liner which providing you healthier foods. Paper Liner Bottom Diameter: 6.3 inches. Please measure your air fryer bottom to make sure that the paper is fit. 【Wide Applications】: These air fryer parchment paper liners are great for baking, roasting, frying, steamer, frying pan, microwave, air fryer and serving foods. Suitable for home baking, camping, BBQ, party and so on. Including 100pcs of paper liners, offer a wide range of choices for your daily cooking, baking and replacement needs. Just throw away the parchment paper liner after use. No need to clean the fryer anymore. 【100% Money-Back Guarantee】: We are committed to serving our customers with reliable products and empathetic service. Your purchase is cover by 100% money-back guarantee within 1 year warranty. If you do not satisfied with our air fryer disposable paper liner, please contact us, we will send you a new replacement or full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7112Ek382OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vioetry","source_asin":"B0BNLLZZ58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNLLZZ58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNLLZZ58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
