window.products.push({"id":707484,"name":"Ankuwa Electric Can Opener, Can Opener Electric Food Safe Use, No Sharp Edge Electric Can Openers for Kitchen, Automatic Can Opener for Seniors, Arthr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IefyY3a4L._AC_SL1143_.jpg","description":"Electric can opener is best kitchen gadgets, handsfree electric can opener is suitable for the elderly and arthritis & weak hands. Electric can opener is pioneer woman kitchen accessories.   Specifications: Dimensions: 6.69 x 2.83 x 2.05 inches Weight: 6.7 ounces   How to open the battery back cover: 1. Face the back of the  can openers electric to us and hold the electric can opener with both hands. 2. Two thumbs side by side on the back of the electric can opener. 3. Slide your thumb down hard. 4. Open the battery cover and insert the battery.   How to use: 1. Put the can on a flat surface and then put the electric can opener on the can. (The edge of the can must be in the groove of the iron sheet and the blade) 2. Press and hold the button for one second and release it, the can opener will automatically cut the side of the can. 3. After the cutting is completed, immediately press the button to reverse the cutter. 4. Make sure that the motor stops after the cutter returns to the original position. Then remove the electric can opener from the can.   Tips: *The iron piece of the electric can opener must be pressed by the can before the button will work. * If the battery is exhausted, pressing the button may not release the jar. Slide the battery cover back and replace 2 AA batteries. The  can openers electric should continue to cut. Remember to replace the battery. *If the can is stuck, press the black button at the end of the  can openers electric. Rotate it in the opposite direction to release the can. * Jars with heavy seams and uneven edges may block the can opener. If this happens, follow the steps above to release the can.   Package includes: 1* Electric can opener 1* Manual for electric can op","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IefyY3a4L._AC_SL1143_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ankuwa","source_asin":"B09ZQF8T1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZQF8T1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZQF8T1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
