window.products.push({"id":707646,"name":"Aserson 1200 ml/40 oz Glass Teapot, Heat Resistant, Stainless Steel Infuser, Handmade, Leaf Tea Brewer, Borosilicate Glass, Stovetop Teapot and Microw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615WeH6hBaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Aserson Glass Teapot is handmade, has a Stylish Design and an Ergonomic Handle. All metal parts of the Glass Teapot are made of Stainless Steel and can be easily removed for easy maintenance Fine mesh Tea Strainer contributes to fast tea brewing and keeps most of the tea leaves from getting into the beverage. The spout of the teapot has a special Non-Drip style. An ergonomically designed handle gives you a sturdy grip, pour and fill. The teapot volume is 1200 ml/40 oz which is enough for 6 cups of tea FOR TEA AND COFFEE: The glass teapot is perfect for brewing your favorite assortment of teas such as red raspberry leaf tea, green tea leaf, lemon loaf tea, and many others, for your enjoyment. This unique product is also used for brewing ground coffee BOROSILICATE GLASS: This glass teapot is made using borosilicate glass, which gives it increased heat resistance, retains the shine and transparency of the walls, even after prolonged use. Also, borosilicate glass maintains heat better, so the tea will be warm longer. All metal parts are made of food-grade stainless steel EASY TO USE: In order to make tea in our glass teapot, it is required,to put the right amount of tea into the filter and pour boiling water. Then let the tea brew If you want to brew flower tea or tea bags, remove the filter and place the flower or tea bags on the bottom of the teapot. After that, pour the right amount of boiling water and let the tea brew. Also, our teapot is suitable for making coffee. You can heat the tea on an electric stove, in the microwave (having removed all the metal elements before) YOU GET: One glass teapot made of borosilicate glass with a removable stainless steel infuser.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615WeH6hBaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aserson","source_asin":"B09DNWR7KQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DNWR7KQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DNWR7KQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
