window.products.push({"id":707689,"name":"Krups 270-71 DuoThek Thermal 8-Cup Coffeemaker, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q-UPkzh8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Essentially it's like two coffeemakers in one. You can use both sides, perhaps making both decaf and regular coffee, or you can use just one side. They operate independently but can be used simultaneously. The double wall thermal carafes will keep your coffee hot and fresh for hours, another reason this machine is ideal for office use and entertaining. Krups' exclusive Deep Brew system has special filtering action for maximum flavor with minimum bitterness. There is also a special design of the heating and tubing system which minimizes calcification and leaves no residual water when the brewing cycle is completed. Amazon.com Your husband prefers a cup of dark French Roast in the morning, but you prefer to finish off a whole pot of mild, lighter-bodied coffee during the course of the day. How to satisfy everyone? This dual coffeemaker has two independent carafes, filter holders, water chambers, and water level indicators so you can simultaneously brew up to eight cups of each persons favorite blend. The DuoThek is also great for offering both caffeinated and decaffeinated coffee at dinner parties or in a small office. Krups special Deep Brew System employs a unique filtering action to enrich the flavor of any ground beans, and a double-walled filter preserves coffee aroma and keeps brewing at the optimum temperature. The controls on this coffeemaker are few and simple. They consist of separate illuminated power switches for each side of the coffeemaker and a button that slows the brewing cycle down when brewing less than three cups (works on the left side of the coffeemaker only). Each of the thermal glass carafes is double insulated to keep beverages hot for hours and includes plastic screw-top lids for additional heat retention. This coffeemaker uses paper filters and is covered by a limited one-year warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q-UPkzh8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KRUPS","source_asin":"B00007CWF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00007CWF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00007CWF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
