window.products.push({"id":707758,"name":"Artanis Home Refillable Amber Glass Hand Soap / Hand Sanitizer Dispenser 16 oz, 2-Pack – Ceramic Printed Apothecary Bottle with Stainless Steel Pumps","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81As-TpzTWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With elegantly sloping shoulders, our apothecary bottles are sure to impress! A rare find in America, the bottle, called \"sirop\" in other countries, harkens to medicine bottles of times past, and is available today as this set of two with your stylish, modern pumps and applied ceramic label (ACL).  Like the soda bottles of decades past that are still collectors' items today, the ceramic print is fired at 1200 degrees for extreme durability and longevity, permanently bonded to the glass. No labels that you have to apply yourself, no label tags around the glass, just simple, clean contemporary text and frame -- a classy, minimalist design that coordinates with all Artanis Home pre-printed products.The large apothecary bottle holds 16 fluid ounces of liquid (500 ml), so won't need to be refilled often. The amber provides good uv protection for products containing essential oils and others that are sensitive to light. The apothecary bottle with pump stands about 8.75\" tall and is 3\" in diameter. Artanis Home is a small, family owned business - a husband and wife team in Southern California. We personally cut each pump's dip tube to just about reach the bottom, bubble wrap, and box the items by hand for the Amazon warehouse. Any problems? We're here to help!We searched for two years to find these gorgeous \"sirop\" bottles that appear to be commonplace in other countries. Eventually, we decided to import them ourselves from China. We hope you love them as much as we do!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81As-TpzTWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artanis Home","source_asin":"B08L1DCYM7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L1DCYM7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L1DCYM7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
