window.products.push({"id":707925,"name":"Accfore 2 Pack Christmas Silicone Baking Molds,Nonstick Silicone Cake Molds for Making Holiday Chocolate Candy,Soap,Candles,Bath Bombs,Fondant,Cake & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a-Xh2CB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY SILICONE - This cake mold is made of food grade silicone, which is perfect for making cakes, chocolate, pudding, etc. NON-STICK & SOFT - The molds are flexible which can be bent easily. It’s more convenient to use than the hard-plastic molds which may crack when you get the cake out, these won't easily break. Easy to Wash: These non-stick silicone molds should be washed in hot soapy water. Multiple Uses: Perfect for molding chocolate, homemade soap, ice cubes, butter, cake decorations, bath bombs, wax candles, jello and fondant. CONTENT - 2 x Silicone Holiday Candy Molds (Green) , Perfect for Holiday parties and Christmas Gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a-Xh2CB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Accfore","source_asin":"B09GJN2QWV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GJN2QWV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GJN2QWV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":707926,"name":"Garcima Cast Iron Olla - 2 Liter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MPf-Yth5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hearty stews flavored with chorizo and smoky paprika are a delicious tradition, especially in central and northern Spain. The stews simmer in a pot for hours while the flavors of these classic dishes develop into a beautiful balance of flavors. Whether your recipe calls for beans such as fabada, garbanzos or lentils, this rustic iron stew pot is the perfect way to prepare the cocidos and other stews of Spain. Traditionally a hefty iron ‘olla’ stew pot would sit over a wood fire in Spanish homes, bubbling with delicious flavors. Our supplier uses solid iron to cast these heavy duty pots, recreating the cookware tradition of old. This 2 quart pot can sit right on your stove, with the solid iron retaining heat as it cooks. The interior is coated with enamel so that it is easy to clean. Each pot comes with a fitted lid to keep the moisture and flavor inside where it belongs. Clean your ‘olla’ stew pot with soapy water before first use. After each use, clean by hand and coat lightly with sunflower oil to prevent rust. The pot will change color over time, taking on a bit of the flavor of each stew you prepare. This solid iron pot will last for generations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MPf-Yth5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Garcima","source_asin":"B000QYP5PA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-707926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000QYP5PA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000QYP5PA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
